# Evendo, Waking Haven: station's charge counters add up over turns. Lake-town Mariners (6 power), cast on turn 1, stations
# at once (its cost taps a creature, not {T}: CR 107.5, 302.6) for six counters, though Evendo itself entered tapped (station
# has no {T} of its own). On turn 3, with six counters, the 12+ ability is not there (CR 721.2a: "as long as this permanent
# has N or more charge counters"), though Evendo is untapped and Mox Emerald could pay its {G}; the Mariners station again
# for six more, and at twelve it is: {G}, {T} adds {G} for each creature Bot1 controls - the Mariners and the Llanowar
# Elves (CR 106.5). Past its last threshold station is still there (CR 721.4; ruling: "you can still activate its station
# ability"), and a third station makes eighteen.

